iv><div><div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"offense\"><h4>Offense</h4><hr /><strong>Speed</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"speed\">  <li>Land 40 ft</li>  </ul><br />  <strong>Melee</strong> 2 claws +7 (1d6+5 plus grab), bite +7 (1d6+5)<br />   <ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\">  <li><strong>Space</strong> 10 ft</li>   <li><strong>Reach</strong> 5 ft</li>  </ul> <br />  </div></div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"statistics\"><h4>Statistics</h4><hr /><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"attributes\"><li><strong>Str</strong> 21</li><li><strong>Dex</strong> 13</li><li><strong>Con</strong> 19</li><li><strong>Int</strong> 2</li><li><strong>Wis</strong> 12</li><li><strong>Cha</strong> 6</li></ul><br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\" data-content=\"base-attack\"><li><strong>Base Atk</strong>+3</li><li><strong>CMB</strong> +9 (+13 grapple)</li><li><strong>CMD</strong> 20  (24 vs. trip) </li></ul><br />  <strong>Feats</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"feats\">  <li>Endurance</li>  <li>Run</li>  <li>Skill Focus <ul class=\"sbcCommaList sbcParensWrappedList\">  <li>Survival</li>  </ul></li>  </ul><br />   <strong>Skills</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"skills\">  <li>Perception +6</li>  <li>Survival +5</li>  <li>Swim +14</li>  </ul>  <br />     </div>  <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"ecology\"><h4>Ecology</h4><hr />  <strong>Environment</strong>   cold forests <br />   <strong>Organization</strong>  solitary or pair <br />   <strong>Treasure</strong>  none   <br />  </div>      <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"description\"><h4> Description </h4><hr /><div class=\"sbcPreWrap\">\nA large, powerful omnivore, the grizzly bear inhabits many of the world's forested hills. Equally happy consuming nuts, berries, fish, or small mammals, the grizzly is nonetheless fiercely territorial, and will chase off-or, failing that, kill and eat-any intruders it views as competition.\n\nWhen faced with a foe or small group of threats, the grizzly attempts to subdue or kill with its claws.\n\nWhen it can, the bear tries to grab a single target to deal continual damage until that target is dead, unconscious, or escapes.\n\nTo generate stats for a smaller bear (like a black bear), you can apply the young simple template to the grizzly bear's stat block. To generate stats for a larger grizzly or a polar bear, apply the advanced simple template to the grizzly's stats.\n</div></div>  </div><hr class=\"sbcBorder\" /></div><p></p></div><br /><hr /><div class=\"rawInputContainer\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><h2 style=\"text-align:middle;border:none;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000\">RAW INPUT</h2><hr /><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:14px\">    Grizzly Bear (CR 4)\nSource PFRPG Bestiary \nCR 4 \nXP 1,200 \nN Large animal  \nInit +1; Senses low-light vision, scent ; Perception +6   \nDefense   \nAC 16, touch 10, flat-footed 15 (+1 Dex, +6 natural, -1 size)\n\nhp 42 (5d8+20)\n\nFort +8, Ref +5, Will +2   \nOffense   \nSpd 40 ft. \nMelee 2 claws +7 (1d6+5 plus grab), bite +7 (1d6+5)\n\nSpace 10 ft.; Reach 5 ft.   \nStatistics   \nStr 21, Dex 13, Con 19, Int 2, Wis 12, Cha 6 \nBase Atk +3; CMB +9 (+13 grapple); CMD 20 (24 vs. trip)\n\nFeats Endurance, Run, Skill Focus (Survival)\n\nSkills Perception +6, Survival +5, Swim +14; Racial Modifiers +4 Swim   \nEcology   \nEnvironment  cold forests \nOrganization solitary or pair \nTreasure none   \nDescription\n\nA large, powerful omnivore, the grizzly bear inhabits many of the world's forested hills. Equally happy consuming nuts, berries, fish, or small mammals, the grizzly is nonetheless fiercely territorial, and will chase off-or, failing that, kill and eat-any intruders it views as competition.\n\nWhen faced with a foe or small group of threats, the grizzly attempts to subdue or kill with its claws.\n\nWhen it can, the bear tries to grab a single target to deal continual damage until that target is dead, unconscious, or escapes.\n\nTo generate stats for a smaller bear (like a black bear), you can apply the young simple template to the grizzly bear's stat block. To generate stats for a larger grizzly or a polar bear, apply the advanced simple template to the grizzly's stats.\n    </pre></div>"},"cr":{"base":4},"xp":{"value":0}},"skills":{"acr":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"apr":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"art":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"blf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"clm":{"ability":"str","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"crf":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dip":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dev":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"dis":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"esc":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"fly":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"han":{"ability":"cha","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"hea":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"int":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kar":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kdu":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"ken":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kge":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"khi":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"klo":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kna":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kno":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kpl":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kre":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lin":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lor":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"per":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":2},"prf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"pro":{"ability":"wis","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"rid":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"sen":{"ability":"wis